<main class="legal-page" style="padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-20);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px;">
    <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--color-accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
      LEGAL & COMPLIANCE
    </div>
    
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem); font-family: var(--font-serif); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); line-height: 1.2;">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted-foreground); margin-bottom: var(--space-8); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding-bottom: var(--space-4);">
      Last Updated: September 2026 • Effective Immediately
    </p>

    <div class="article-prose">
      <p style="font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-foreground);">
        At <strong>EUREKA</strong>, we believe that exploring science, psychology, and ideas should never come at the cost of your digital privacy. This Privacy Policy details the limited data we collect, how it is safeguarded, and how you retain full sovereignty over your information.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Our Privacy First Guarantee</h2>
      <p>
        EUREKA operates under a strict privacy-first architecture:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No Data Brokering:</strong> We do not sell, rent, monetize, or trade reader data to data brokers or advertising networks.</li>
        <li><strong>No Invasive Fingerprinting:</strong> We do not employ canvas fingerprinting, cross-site trackers, or third-party behavioral profiling scripts.</li>
        <li><strong>Zero Unnecessary Cookies:</strong> We only store strictly necessary functional preferences (such as your chosen Light/Dark theme mode) in local browser storage.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect only the minimum data required to deliver a responsive, secure reading experience:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact Dispatches:</strong> When you send a message through our Contact page, we collect your name, email address, and message content solely to respond to your inquiry.</li>
        <li><strong>Aggregate Telemetry:</strong> Anonymized server-side request metrics (HTTP status codes, requested paths, anonymized IP prefixes) used strictly for detecting denial-of-service attempts and broken links.</li>
        <li><strong>Local Storage Preferences:</strong> Your selected theme preference (<code>eureka-theme</code>) and cookie consent status are retained purely on your own device.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Technical Security & Protection Measures</h2>
      <p>
        All communications with EUREKA are encrypted using Transport Layer Security (TLS 1.3). Our backend infrastructure employs in-memory sliding-window rate limiting, input sanitization to eliminate Cross-Site Scripting (XSS), and strict Content Security Policies (CSP) with HSTS preloading.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Your Rights Under GDPR & CCPA</h2>
      <p>
        Regardless of your geographic location, EUREKA extends full data privacy rights to all readers:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right of Access:</strong> You may request a copy of any correspondence or information associated with your email.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Erasure ("Right to Be Forgotten"):</strong> You may request the immediate deletion of any submitted contact correspondence.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> You may correct any inaccurate contact information submitted to our editorial team.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Editorial & Data Protection Office</h2>
      <p>
        To exercise any privacy rights, report security concerns, or ask questions regarding this policy, please reach out directly:
      </p>
      <div style="padding: var(--space-6); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background-color: var(--color-card); margin: var(--space-6) 0;">
        <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;">EUREKA Data Protection & Editorial Office</div>
        <div style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted-foreground); margin-bottom: 8px;">
          Nagpur & Nanded, Maharashtra, India
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: var(--text-sm);">
          <strong>Direct Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:poharekulbhushan2006@gmail.com" style="color: var(--color-accent);">poharekulbhushan2006@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

